WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.250
- Hello and welcome to
the Yale2020 website.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.860
I'm Kimberly Goff-Crews,

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.713
Secretary and Vice President
for University Life.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.590
Although traditional
Commencement ceremonies

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.300
will have to wait until
we can meet in person,

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.740
we couldn't let this time
pass without celebrating

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.883
all members of the Yale
University Class of 2020.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.640
As you explore this site,

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.500
you'll find content from the university

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.200
and from your schools.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.650
We hope it will help you reflect
on your experience at Yale

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.203
and all you have accomplished.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.570
We'll continue to add content

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.010
throughout the week and after May 18th,

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.490
and will keep the site
live for several months.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.860
We'd really love to add
your photos and your videos.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.380
You can contribute by using
the links on the website

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.363
or #Yale2020 on social media.

00:00:49.304 --> 00:00:51.690
On Monday, May 18th,

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.640
beginning at 11 a.m.
Eastern Standard Time,

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.760
President Salovey's
address to the students,

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.690
and the official conferral of student

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:01.350
and honorary degrees will be live.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.600
Chaplain Kugler will also share a blessing

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.723
and many schools will follow
with their own programming.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.610
We hope you enjoy the site.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:11.810
And on behalf of all of us at Yale,

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.890
warm congratulations to our graduates,

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:16.023
and their proud families and friends.

